# ── AI (receipt scanning + voice parsing) ──────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local (for `vercel dev`) or set in your host's env settings.
#
# Uses Alibaba DashScope (Tongyi Qwen), which works from mainland China.
# Get a key at https://dashscope.console.aliyun.com/ (百炼/DashScope 控制台).
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=

# Optional model overrides.
# AI_VISION_MODEL=qwen-vl-max        # reads receipt photos
# AI_TEXT_MODEL=qwen-plus            # parses voice/typed expenses

# Optional: point at any other OpenAI-compatible domestic provider
# (Zhipu GLM, Kimi, Doubao, …). Then set the matching model names above.
# AI_BASE_URL=https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1

# ── Cloud sync (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave blank to keep data local-only. To enable multi-device sync, create a
# LeanCloud (国内版) app and paste its keys. These are read at build time, so
# they must be prefixed with VITE_.
VITE_LEANCLOUD_APP_ID=
VITE_LEANCLOUD_APP_KEY=
VITE_LEANCLOUD_SERVER_URL=
